message: "Please cite BRANCHSNV using this metadata."
title: "BRANCHSNV"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "White"
    given-names: "Rhys T."
version: 0.1.0a1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RhysWhite/branchsnv"
abstract: >-
  BRANCHSNV is a dependency-free Python command-line tool for reporting strict
  clade-exclusive nucleotide markers separately from single-nucleotide
  substitutions reconstructed on selected edges of rooted phylogenetic trees.
keywords:
  - phylogenetics
  - bacterial genomics
  - single-nucleotide variant
  - NEXUS
  - Newick
